    "name": "Twitch IGDB Media API",
    "description": "The Internet Game Database (IGDB) API provides comprehensive video game information including metadata, ratings, screenshots, videos, and media. IGDB is owned and operated by Twitch and uses Twitch OAuth for authentication. The API uses a POST-based query language called Apicalypse.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: IGDB Support",
